    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest at the Crossroads is a walking simulator that transports the player to a merchant village, located at the crossroads of ancient trading routes. As a mysterious newcomer you are given a list of items to find, in order to get them, you must explore the village and look into all the alleys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/be75055d434958c872284a744cece40c.poster.avif?t=1741253348\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/be75055d434958c872284a744cece40c.webm?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/be75055d434958c872284a744cece40c.mp4?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mysterious visitor, you are given a list of items to find - these can be rare goods, everyday trinkets or quirky souvenirs hiding untold stories. To get them, you need to delve into the world of the village, wander the cobbled streets, visit markets and peer into hidden alleys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel without Haste</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/5f726f5dd4276f8ddad062cdb4c59eeb.poster.avif?t=1741253348\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/5f726f5dd4276f8ddad062cdb4c59eeb.webm?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/5f726f5dd4276f8ddad062cdb4c59eeb.mp4?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest at the Crossroads doesn't focus on time pressure or competition - instead it encourages slow exploration, careful observation and enjoying the atmosphere. It's an ideal proposition for those who value immersion, non-linear storytelling and exploring the world at their own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest at the Crossroads is a walking simulator that transports the player to a merchant village, located at the crossroads of ancient trading routes. As a mysterious newcomer you are given a list of items to find, in order to get them, you must explore the village and look into all the alleys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/be75055d434958c872284a744cece40c.poster.avif?t=1741253348\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/be75055d434958c872284a744cece40c.webm?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/be75055d434958c872284a744cece40c.mp4?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mysterious visitor, you are given a list of items to find - these can be rare goods, everyday trinkets or quirky souvenirs hiding untold stories. To get them, you need to delve into the world of the village, wander the cobbled streets, visit markets and peer into hidden alleys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel without Haste</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/5f726f5dd4276f8ddad062cdb4c59eeb.poster.avif?t=1741253348\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508750/extras/5f726f5dd4276f8ddad062cdb4c59eeb.webm?t=1741253348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it